<Item class="ModuleScript" referent="RBX822E13A19957423A870E2CA364314F5F"><Properties><string name="Name">Audio</string><ProtectedString name="Source"><![CDATA[-- Roblox asset IDs of the uploaded audio files (folder audio/ in the project, made by tools/music/make_audio.py).
-- 0 = not uploaded yet: the game simply stays silent for that part.
